{"id":"wb-5-s3211","name":"焦裕禄烈士墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"焦裕禄烈士墓","text":"焦裕禄烈士墓，是一座位于河南省开封市兰考县的全国重点文物保护单位。焦裕禄生前曾任河南开封市兰考县的县委书记，死后被批准为革命烈士；他起初葬于郑州市烈士公墓，后来遂其遗愿迁葬到现址，其墓是焦裕禄烈士陵园的一部分。后来，不少中华人民共和国高层领导人、中国共产党党员干部到访了焦裕禄烈士陵园；截至2003年4月，焦裕禄烈士墓共接待了超过500万人次的访客。2003年4月，焦裕禄烈士墓被增补列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%84%A6%E8%A3%95%E7%A6%84%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93","revisionId":91309740,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91309740","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e726be8d8643f1e6715da2dd.jpg","title":"20260129_Memorial_Park_of_Jiao_Yulu_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260129_Memorial_Park_of_Jiao_Yulu_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/20260129_Memorial_Park_of_Jiao_Yulu_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​兰考 焦裕禄纪念园内的焦裕禄墓","width":320,"height":213}}